n can carry the broader frame:\n\n> **Authority / Seat / Owner / Objective / Givens / Context / TODO / Artifact / Constraints / Acceptance / Stop / Handoff / Return**\n\nAnd just like header/footer mode, we should be able to **toggle prompt mode explicitly** rather than improvising each time.\n\nSo yes—add another paired taxonomy item:\n\n**SESSION PROFILE**\n- Quick\n- Build\n\n**PROMPT PROFILE**\n- Shorthand\n- Full\n\nThen we review both line by line and decide what is mandatory versus optional."]}, "create_time": 1790370441.721688, "end_turn": true, "id": "4231961e-4205-4a71-8042-bb50ff848bc4", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [], "content_references": [], "conversation_followup_suggestions_eligible": true, "cot_version": "v5", "default_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "finish_details": {"stop_tokens": [200002], "type": "stop"}, "gizmo_id": "g-p-6ab43fca21d0819183966405a724bf5d", "is_complete": true, "message_type": "next", "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "model_switcher_deny": [], "parent_id": "24fa7a41-9de6-4260-b2db-71ad151f3458", "request_id": "4e4b0261-fd21-4a77-8907-40cda2a23bb1", "resolved_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "search_result_groups": [], "story_events": [], "thinking_effort": "standard", "turn_exchange_id": "23ce6438-4872-424e-b002-9d53285148fc", "working_turn_id": "23ce6438-4872-424e-b002-9d53285148fc"}, "recipient": "all", "status": "finished_successfully", "update_time": 1790370447.335215, "weight": 1}, {"author": {"metadata": {}, "name": null, "role": "user"}, "channel": null, "content": {"content_type": "text", "parts": ["ok good lets look at this LUCE VERIFICATION — NETWORK TRUTH TEST\nFirst: your v1 script produced a false negative. Do not trust that report.\nTwo defects, both now isolated:\n1. Test-Connection -TargetName does not exist in Windows PowerShell 5.1 (correct: -ComputerName). With -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue it swallowed the error and returned nothing → RESULT: NO RESPONSES for all 4 targets. That was the bug,