licy\n- adapter settings\n\nall at once.\n\nWe need attribution.\n\n============================================================\nRETURN FORMAT\n============================================================\n\nEXECUTIVE VERDICT\n\nTHROUGHPUT ROOT CAUSE:\n[best current classification]\n\nSPACE BUNNY ROOT CAUSE:\n[best current classification or UNKNOWN]\n\nCONTROL DEVICE RESULT:\n[value / pending]\n\nCURRENT WIFI PHY:\n[value]\n\nCURRENT REAL THROUGHPUT:\n[value]\n\nWHY 1/8/16 STREAM RESULTS MATTER:\n[technical explanation]\n\nCLIENT-SIDE FINDINGS:\n[list]\n\nNETWORK-SIDE FINDINGS:\n[list]\n\nSPACE BUNNY ACTUAL PROVIDER/RUNTIME PATH:\n[verified configuration only]\n\nRANKED ROOT-CAUSE TABLE:\n[cause / evidence / confidence]\n\nONE FIRST FIX:\n[exact action]\n\nBEFORE/AFTER TEST:\n[exact measurement]\n\nROLLBACK:\n[exact reversal]\n\nWHAT NOT TO TOUCH:\n[list]\n\nCONFIDENCE:\n[0–100%]\n\nSTOP.\n\nDo not create additional architecture.\nDo not redesign GCE.\nDo not give Don five unrelated troubleshooting scripts.\nSolve this specific problem.\n```\n\n**That’s the pass I’d give Space Bunny or GLM.**\n\nAnd I’d actually favor **GLM for the independent diagnosis first**, because we want someone to challenge both Luce’s conclusions and mine rather than inherit the same line of reasoning. Then, if GLM isolates a client-side fix, **Space Bunny/Nico can execute it surgically**.\n\n**OWNER:** Independent investigator  \n**NEXT:** GLM full forensic challenge → one fix only  \n**STOP CONDITION:** One evidence-backed intervention with before/after measurement"]}, "create_time": 1790376444.789583, "end_turn": true, "id": "1cc60212-0ee5-4657-974a-52e5ea182328", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [], "code_blocks": {"0": {"edited": false, "id": "wo7dlc", "preview_language": null, "previewable": false}}, "content_references": [], "conversation_followup_suggestions_eligible": true, "cot_version": "v5", "default_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "finish_details": {"stop_tokens": 